# supabase functions deploy social-publish-cron --no-verify-jwt
# npm run social:publish  (test manuel queue)
# GitHub: workflow social-publish-cron.yml (backup */10 min) + secret SOCIAL_PUBLISH_CRON_SECRET

# ── Producer tag mix (Edge functions producer-tag + apply-producer-tag → /api/producer-tag-mix via ffmpeg-static) ──
# Vercel (API route) : aucune var nécessaire côté Vercel (PRODUCER_TAG_MIX_SECRET requis pour valider les appels entrants)
# Vercel env : PRODUCER_TAG_MIX_SECRET=<random 32+ octets hex>
# Supabase Edge secrets : supabase secrets set PRODUCER_TAG_MIX_URL=https://www.producerhit.com PRODUCER_TAG_MIX_SECRET=<même secret>
# Sans ça, apply-producer-tag renvoie "mix_not_configured" et aucun tag ne peut être appliqué.
# PRODUCER_TAG_MIX_URL=https://www.producerhit.com
# PRODUCER_TAG_MIX_SECRET=

# ── Trend remix YouTube (2 chaînes landscape, chansons complètes) ──
# TREND_REMIX_YOUTUBE_ACCOUNTS=remix1,remix2
# TREND_REMIX_AUTO_PUBLISH=1
# TREND_REMIX_LANDSCAPE_THEME=cinematic-glow
# TREND_REMIX_DURATION_SEC=90
# TREND_REMIX_MAX_SEC=600
